D7AF][/dim]authority, and `bob capture` / `capture-parse` stay literal.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim] Counts: [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]5[dim][/bold #D7AFFF] phases[dim][/dim] · [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]4[dim][/bold #D7AFFF] waves[/dim]\n[dim]   Path: [#87AFFF][/dim]plan:202611/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]relation_equals_alias_and_direction_flips.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim] Prompt: [#87AFFF][/dim]prompts/202611/relation_equals_alias_and_direction_flips.md[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Bead: [#87AFFF][/dim]bob-cli-hz[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Page: [#87AFFF][/dim]https://github.com/bobs-org/bob-cli--beads/blob/main/pages/bob-cli-hz/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]README.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim]  1 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Mac relation label card flips direction[/bold #D7AFFF]                       [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]card-flip[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]card-flip: in the Mac relation label card, `~`/`=` flip the relation in [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]choose mode, edit the token, re-fetch catalog and verdicts, and support [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]a fast `==` literal escape. Also adds teaching keycaps and fixes Escape [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]from a Shift-Return card. Mac only.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  2 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Bob capture-rewrite relation grammar[/bold #D7AFFF]                          [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]bob-grammar[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]bob-grammar: in bob-cli capture-rewrite, an `=` opener replaces the [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]relation `-` alias, `~~=` gives `~`, and a new [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]`toggle_relation_direction` rule flips a complete token on a glued [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]`~`/`=`. Ships with docs, help, and tests as `feat(capture)!`.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  3 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Mac adopts the = opener and post-token flip[/bold #D7AFFF]                   [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]mac-equals-opener[dim] · [dim][/dim]after card-flip, bob-grammar[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]mac-equals-opener: the Mac forwards `=` and token-glued `~` to Bob and [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]replaces the dash arm with an equals opener arm that keeps the [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]Space/Escape restores. It applies `toggle_relation_direction` natively [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]without a picker and deletes every relation `-` path.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  4 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Fast == escape in the editor and picker[/bold #D7AFFF]                       [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]equals-escape[dim] · [dim][/dim]after mac-equals-opener[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]equals-escape: one shared equals-gesture record with a ~350 ms [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]key-to-key window, so a fast second `=` undoes whatever the first `=` [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]did and types one `=`. Covers the editor before and after Bob replies, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]every flip, and the picker; the card reuses it.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  5 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Decision record, relation docs, and parity follow-up[/bold #D7AFFF]          [bold black on #87D7FF] small  [/bold black on #87D7FF]\n    [#AF87FF]records[dim] · [dim][/dim]after bob-grammar, equals-escape[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]records: author the decision record for the new gestures and partly [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]supersede the card's catalog-fetched-once claim. Add the [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]docs/task-relations.md sentence, and file the Obsidian label-stage [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]parity bead.[/#D7D7AF]","clan_tribe":"epic","epic_bead_id":"bob-cli-hz","llm_provider":"grok","model":"grok-4.6","patch_name":"gh_bobs-org__bob-cli","phase_bead_id":"bob-cli-hz.1","reasoning_effort":"high","role_suffix":"plan","vcs_provider":"GitHub","workflow_name":"bob-cli-hz.1"},"so